## real recorded runs (10-real-runs-cwd-binding.log, HEAD 8c5a694)
63 runs with a transcript: init cwd == meta.cwd for all 63 (0 init mismatches; every resume init line too).
Replayed-prompt 'Your working directory is' == meta.cwd for all 26 runs that carry a string-content replayed prompt;
the 37 others (LOAD, AN-01..10, reviews R1-R6) predate D-022 prompt replay and would already fail the pre-existing
replayed-prompt check, so the new line changes nothing for them. 3 runs skipped as in progress / no transcript (this run; R5 QA/SEC).
## judgement
PASS: meta.cwd is now bound to both transcript-produced statements; one-field and two-field forgeries are rejected (QA13-V5, QA14-V2..V5).
Limits (not findings; disclosed residual 1, self-hashed run evidence): QA14-V6 whole-evidence consistent forgery and
QA14-V7 an extra resume init line with another cwd are accepted. Neither can be produced by the runner (single --cwd for all attempts).
